4.22.m:
In Śrāvaṇa, one should then worship the god Śrīkaṇṭha accompanied by his son;
in the month of Bhādrapada, one should sacrifice to Bhīma accompanied by Durgā;
in the month of Kārttika, one should sacrifice to Īśāna united with the goddess Śivā.

4.37.m:
Śrī Kṛṣṇa said:
It is heard that formerly auspicious Śrī was born of Khyāti from Bhṛgu;
she was given to Vāsudeva by the sage to augment his honour.
